<title>BELGIUM: THE GOOD, THE BAD AND THE HUNGRY.</title>
<headline>THE GOOD, THE BAD AND THE HUNGRY.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two armed and masked men robbed two newsagents shops in the Belgian city of Genk on Monday but ended up with little bounty, the Belga newsagency said.</p>
<p>They left empty-handed from the first attack and managed to grab only a handful of chocolate bars in the second.</p>
<p>There were no injuries reported and police were still trying to wrap up the case.</p>
